== Course Syllabus

+ Introduction
+ Digital Computer Structure
+ Information Representation and Processing
+ Memory
+ Arithmetic Logic Unit
+ Didactic Computer Architecture
+ Assembly Languages
+ Input/Output Subsystem
+ Interrupts
+ Microprogramming

== Course Objectives

- General knowledge of computer architecture
  - Information representation
  - Memory
  - Instruction sets
  - Instruction encoding
  - Assembly language
  - Processor interrupts
- Describing processor hardware using Verilog

